  "description": "This elegant romantic couple sitting together line art design features a woman leaning gently on her partner, creating a warm and intimate silhouette. The delicate outline stitches capture tenderness, connection, and calm emotion—perfect for heartfelt gifts and keepsakes. Add this minimal, modern design to apparel, framed décor, pillows, and personalized couple items.\nThis machine embroidery design comes with multiple embroidery file formats and can be used with multiple embroidery machines.",
